pkg:Evidence_v1_15_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.15.0 (STORY-3 closed -- first real Path B interactive-page artifact shipped)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: continuation of last turn's real execution. Copied the cleaned, verified page to its real package location (04-interactive-page/code_abundance_page_v1_0_0.html, 976187 bytes). Closed the backlog with real, per-item Evidence: TASK-2 (Citations table patched, programmatically confirmed old citations absent and new ones present); TASK-3 (systematic cleaning -- COMPANY_DATA, SKOS_TTL, and LINEAGE_TTL, the last explicitly documented as regenerated-not-hand-edited and found still carrying 236KB of the prior subject's own lineage history, all emptied; COACH_AGENT honestly replaced rather than fabricated; a genuine functional bug in an intent-detection regex keyed to the prior subject's own framework names fixed); TASK-4 (real headless Playwright verification, including catching and fixing a genuine bug this session's own earlier fix had introduced -- a hardcoded 5-company key list crashing against the newly-emptied COMPANY_DATA, found via a real JS stack trace, fixed by deriving the key list from actual data, then re-verified: 0 console/page errors across load and real tab interaction). STORY-3 itself closed with its own Evidence and a real, observable-behaviour AcceptanceCriterion. Filed a second proposal to the corpus-template's owner: optional fields are left with the prior subject's data when a new corpus omits them rather than being emptied, demonstrated with the real bug this caused. Not applied upstream (B1). Re-verified: pipeline order unaffected, full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "0bd1fc1bdc1eda665b0ef75b3fd3b70864fb4f218591c7b785e07ec6a51fbbc7"^^xsd:string .
